      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我明白。可是我非得赢过小栗她们，\n不然就永远无法证明我爬上了“巅峰”。\n所以这反而正合我意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37586750aa52d1c8f96c59d46134bb6da5d0f48a8fda67dc085b26686560f50a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
